[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18420.23, "timestamp": "05:07:00", "text": "因为，嗯，就在不久前，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18421.83, "timestamp": "05:07:01", "text": "我没注意到，就像我一直在使用……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18423.91, "timestamp": "05:07:03", "text": "我一直使用的那些叠加层"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18428.23, "timestamp": "05:07:08", "text": "我已开始。嗯。而且它有点像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18430.31, "timestamp": "05:07:10", "text": "就像在那一刻，它不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18433.91, "timestamp": "05:07:13", "text": "这并不是我关注的重点，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18437.11, "timestamp": "05:07:17", "text": "甚至都没注意到它不在里面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18441.35, "timestamp": "05:07:21", "text": "呃，你知道，那种连接或者像呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18443.51, "timestamp": "05:07:23", "text": "与其他美学元素的融合"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18447.35, "timestamp": "05:07:27", "text": "正在进行中。嗯。但现在就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18450.868, "timestamp": "05:07:30", "text": "当你开始有时候呃，只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18453.11, "timestamp": "05:07:33", "text": "待在那里，然后就随便瞥一眼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18457.75, "timestamp": "05:07:37", "text": "看起来有点格格不入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18461.67, "timestamp": "05:07:41", "text": "是的。而且观众可能也会有这种感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18464.788, "timestamp": "05:07:44", "text": "哦，我看到的景色也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18467.03, "timestamp": "05:07:47", "text": "这么多年了。什么？为什么会有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18469.75, "timestamp": "05:07:49", "text": "没什么新鲜事吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18472.628, "timestamp": "05:07:52", "text": "是的。我当时就想，我能理解，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18475.67, "timestamp": "05:07:55", "text": "我真的很喜欢，嗯，目前是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18477.83, "timestamp": "05:07:57", "text": "感觉就像我知道很多"}]